Watermark condition. Images saved by this software (Posity) carry a watermark naming the tool and its
author: "Scanned by Posity," / "-Programmed by Yeony". When using, modifying, or distributing this
software or any derivative work, the following are prohibited:
  1. removing, hiding, or weakening the watermark in saved images so that it is hard to recognize;
  2. modifying the source code so that images are saved without the watermark or with other text;
  3. distributing, or letting others use, software (or any part of it) modified as in 1 or 2.

AI condition. The acts prohibited by the watermark condition are equally prohibited whether done by
hand or with an artificial intelligence system (large language models, code generation or editing
tools, agents, and the like). This includes submitting the source code of this software, or any
part of it, to an AI system in order to have such modifications made or to find a way to make them.

