two conflict, this preface governs. All rights granted by the Apache License 2.0 to use, reproduce,
modify, prepare derivative works of, and distribute the Work (including Sections 2, 3, and 4) are
granted only on condition that every term of this preface is met, and are not granted if any of
them is breached. These conditions do not apply to the copyright holder.

